{"id":"nave:shephatiah","source":"nave","name":"Shephatiah","slug":"shephatiah","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Son of David 2Sa 3:4; 1Ch 3:3","refs":[["2Sam",3,4,3,4],["1Chr",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"2. A Benjamite, father of Meshullam 1Ch 9:8","refs":[["1Chr",9,8,9,8]]},{"text":"3. A valiant man who joined David at Ziklag 1Ch 12:5","refs":[["1Chr",12,5,12,5]]},{"text":"4. A ruler of the tribe of Simeon 1Ch 27:16","refs":[["1Chr",27,16,27,16]]},{"text":"5. Son of Jehoshaphat 2Ch 21:2","refs":[["2Chr",21,2,21,2]]},{"text":"6. The name of two men, ancestors of families which returned to Jerusalem from the captivity in Babylon Ezr 2:4,57; 8:8; Ne 7:9,59","refs":[["Ezra",2,4,2,4],["Ezra",2,57,2,57],["Ezra",8,8,8,8],["Neh",7,9,7,9],["Neh",7,59,7,59]]},{"text":"7. A descendant of Perez Ne 11:4","refs":[["Neh",11,4,11,4]]},{"text":"8. An enemy of Jeremiah Jer 38:1,4","refs":[["Jer",38,1,38,1],["Jer",38,4,38,4]]}],"refCount":14}
